    "highlights": "Underlines utilize precise 1px thickness with a 0.125em offset, often taking 50% opacity of the current text color via color-mix. Syntax highlighting explicitly uses branded ANSI green and red CSS variables to show git/terminal diffs (+135, -21).",
    "insights": [
      "Dual Typography Ecosystem: Employs a custom brand font (CursorGothic) for overarching marketing and narrative elements, transitioning seamlessly to native OS typography (system-ui) within product IDE interfaces to feel familiar and performant.",
      "Granular UI Scales: Product UI tokens (type-product-lg, type-product-base, type-product-sm) rely on exact sub-pixel rem values (e.g., 0.6875rem) paired with tight line-heights (1.27273) to create a highly dense, information-rich developer environment.",
      "High-Fidelity Mimicry: The landing page injects highly specific fonts—such as Lato to mirror a Slack integration and EB Garamond for a simulated browser preview—to identically reproduce external contextual environments."
